  "configuration_id": "config_049",
  "reason": "The current best (config_017, acc=0.725) uses scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted. All component-level comparisons show scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l are the strongest encoders, transformer > avgpool (~0.019 gap), and weighted > concat (~0.004 gap). No untested config replicates the exact best combination, so the goal is to find the closest viable variant. config_049 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, avgpool, concat) retains both top encoders while testing whether the avgpool+concat interaction might produce a different (possibly complementary) signal compared to the individually tested avgpool (config_020, 0.706) and concat (config_007, 0.721) results. It is the highest-expected-accuracy untested option among scvi_n200 multimodal multiprofile configs. Expected cost is moderate (~4.5–5 GPU hours), similar to config_020 (4.82) but potentially slightly cheaper due to concat fusion. This is the best use of experiment 9: it gives a small chance of a surprise interaction effect beating 0.725 while keeping cost reasonable, and the single remaining experiment can then be used to confirm or explore further if needed."
}

